# Input

```scss
$query:"without: rule";
$mode:without;
$rules:media supports;
.namespace{
@at-root(/* whole query */ $query /* before close */){.overlay{position:fixed}}
}
@at-root(/* modifier */ $mode /* before colon */ : /* rules */ $rules /* end */){.clause{color:red}}
@at-root(
// query comment
$query
){.line-comment{color:blue}}
@at-root(without:
// rules comment
media supports
){.rules-comment{color:green}}
@media print{
@supports(display:flex){
.comment-ancestor{
@at-root(/* whole query */ $query /* before close */){.comment-query-filtered{color:purple}}
@at-root(/* modifier */ $mode /* before colon */ : /* rules */ $rules /* end */){.comment-clause-filtered{color:orange}}
@at-root(without:
// rules comment
media
){.comment-media-filtered{color:teal}}
}
}
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$query: "without: rule";
$mode: without;
$rules: media supports;
.namespace {
	@at-root (/* whole query */ $query /* before close */) {
		.overlay {
			position: fixed;
		}
	}
}
@at-root (
	/* modifier */ $mode /* before colon */: /* rules */ $rules /* end */
) {
	.clause {
		color: red;
	}
}
@at-root (
	// query comment
	$query
) {
	.line-comment {
		color: blue;
	}
}
@at-root (
	without: // rules comment
	media supports
) {
	.rules-comment {
		color: green;
	}
}
@media print {
	@supports (display: flex) {
		.comment-ancestor {
			@at-root (/* whole query */ $query /* before close */) {
				.comment-query-filtered {
					color: purple;
				}
			}
			@at-root (
				/* modifier */ $mode /* before colon */: /* rules */ $rules /* end */
			) {
				.comment-clause-filtered {
					color: orange;
				}
			}
			@at-root (
				without: // rules comment
				media
			) {
				.comment-media-filtered {
					color: teal;
				}
			}
		}
	}
}

```
